    "text": "wnegradio.com\nwebsite\nHabersham County, Georgia\nHabersham County Animal Shelter to host 2nd Annual “Howl-Ween Pawty”\nBy Chad Dorsett,\n3 hours agoHabersham County Animal Care and Control (HCACC) is set to host their second annual “Howl-Ween” Pawty. This event hopes to raise funds for free and subsidized Spay/Neuter opportunities for owned pets in Habersham County. The event will be held at Fenders Alley, in Cornelia, on October 25, 2025,...",
